endmethod
-- End of method definition

------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      typeGadgets
--
-- Description: Shows/Hides the gadgets associated with the select type task
--
-- Method Type: Procedure
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
